WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
A small cottage on a cliff.

2
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.680
Out at sea, a ship's sails
shrink towards the horizon.

3
00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.110
He has gone "in search of gain".

4
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.890
The further the ship sails,
the fuller the purse grows.

5
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.420
She remembers him as poor: "No
riches from his scanty store".

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.350
He's going to make her rich.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.420
So why is she in tears?

8
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.930
In this mission, you'll
work out the situation,

9
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.920
stanza by stanza.

10
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.150
You'll hear how its plain,
steady song form works,

11
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.250
eight syllables, then six.

12
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.160
And you'll compare the calm night
sea with the storm in her final line.

13
00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:39.640
Your mission: explain why she is in tears.
